Description: Local AirGradient Gateway, Lossless SQLite Logger & Web Dashboard
 Standalone daemon for Raspberry Pi providing air-gapped 1-second telemetry
 ingestion, monthly partitioned SQLite archiving on flash media, EPA AQI
 processing, and real-time SSE streaming for AirGradient ONE monitors.
